{'symbol': 'DD', 'date': '2021-04-26 11:00:00', 'title': 'DUPONT HONORED WITH RESPONSIBLE CARE® AWARD FOR OUTSTANDING COVID-19 RESPONSE EFFORTS BY THE AMERICAN CHEMISTRY COUNCIL', 'text': 'WILMINGTON, DEL., APRIL 26, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DUPONT (NYSE: DD) TODAY ANNOUNCED IT HAS BEEN NAMED A 2021 RESPONSIBLE CARE® AWARDEE BY THE AMERICAN CHEMISTRY COUNCIL (ACC) FOR OUTSTANDING COVID-19 RESPONSE EFFORTS.'}